reply_text:
@776310 Understood. For the next steps you'll need to know your Apple ID login info:

Go to Settings&gt;Messages&gt;Send &amp; Receive, tap your Apple ID and sign out. After that power the device off fully and then back on. 

Finally sign back in, and let us know if the issue persists.

